Subject: [PATCH 5/6] J714s developer image (upstream): linux-aurora up273-8
 (integration/aurora 3766943238bd, panel VRR opt-in)

linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora17.up273-8 (aurora-silicon/linux integration/aurora 3766943238bd plus
betizzel/omarchy-m5 patches/upstream-27.3/0001, 0004, 0005 and 0008, rolotrealanis98's firmware 27
panel VRR, opt-in with appledrm.fw27_panel_vrr=1), recipe at betizzel/omarchy-m5 e0b6d1c. The J714s
kernel pins follow the new release 7.3.0-17.up273-8-ARCH. Aura (m1n1-aurora up273-3) and the other
packages unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
